    "description": "<p>As an Action, by spending 4 Martial Die you move at such speeds you vanish from sight. Select up to 4 creatures within range of your movement speed, and make a single unarmed attack comparing your results against each of their AC’s, and then teleporting into a space adjacent to one of them. On a hit, you deal your [Unarmed Damage] + 4 Martial Die and must make a Constitution saving throw, being Staggered on a failed save.</p>",
